Type: Package
Package: GREMLINS
Title: Generalized Multipartite Networks
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sophie", "Donnet", , "sophie.donnet@inrae.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4370-7316")),
    person("Pierre", "Barbillon", , "pierre.barbillon@agroparistech.fr", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7766-7693"))
  )
Description: We define generalized multipartite networks as the joint
    observation of several networks implying some common pre-specified
    groups of individuals. The aim is to fit an adapted version of the
    popular stochastic block model to multipartite networks, as described
    in Bar-hen, Barbillon and Donnet (2020) <arXiv:1807.10138>.
